{
  "an4.121:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.121 ",
  "an4.121:0.2": "13. Bhayavagga ",
  "an4.121:0.3": "Attānuvādasutta ",
  "an4.121:1.1": "“Cattārimāni, bhikkhave, bhayāni. ",
  "an4.121:1.2": "Katamāni cattāri? ",
  "an4.121:1.3": "Attānuvādabhayaṁ, parānuvādabhayaṁ, daṇḍabhayaṁ, duggatibhayaṁ. ",
  "an4.121:2.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, attānuvādabhayaṁ? ",
  "an4.121:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco iti paṭisañcikkhati: ",
  "an4.121:2.3": "‘ahañceva kho pana kāyena duccaritaṁ careyyaṁ, vācāya duccaritaṁ careyyaṁ, manasā duccaritaṁ careyyaṁ, kiñca taṁ yaṁ maṁ attā sīlato na upavadeyyā’ti. ",
  "an4.121:2.4": "So attānuvādabhayassa bhīto kāyaduccaritaṁ pahāya kāyasucaritaṁ bhāveti, vacīduccaritaṁ pahāya vacīsucaritaṁ bhāveti, manoduccaritaṁ pahāya manosucaritaṁ bhāveti, suddhaṁ attānaṁ pariharati. ",
  "an4.121:2.5": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, attānuvādabhayaṁ. ",
  "an4.121:3.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, parānuvādabhayaṁ? ",
  "an4.121:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco iti paṭisañcikkhati: ",
  "an4.121:3.3": "‘ahañceva kho pana kāyena duccaritaṁ careyyaṁ, vācāya duccaritaṁ careyyaṁ, manasā duccaritaṁ careyyaṁ, kiñca taṁ yaṁ maṁ pare sīlato na upavadeyyun’ti. ",
  "an4.121:3.4": "So parānuvādabhayassa bhīto kāyaduccaritaṁ pahāya kāyasucaritaṁ bhāveti, vacīduccaritaṁ pahāya vacīsucaritaṁ bhāveti, manoduccaritaṁ pahāya manosucaritaṁ bhāveti, suddhaṁ attāna